adge text-bg-light fw-normal">Per candidate</span></h2><p class="text-muted small mb-3">Targeted retrieval for THIS candidate's specific gaps against THIS job's requirements — in addition to, not a replacement for, the job-level regulations above. This is grounding context only; it does not by itself determine eligibility — the Rule Engine above remains the authoritative source for mandatory requirements.</p>{% if application.ai_rag_context.candidate_legal_evidence %}<div class="row g-3">{% for dimension, info in application.ai_rag_context.candidate_legal_evidence.items %}{% if info.status != 'not_applicable' %}<div class="col-md-6"><div class="border rounded p-3 h-100"><div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 mb-2"><span class="fw-semibold small text-capitalize">{{ dimension }}</span><span class="badge {% if info.status == 'evidence_found' %}text-bg-success{% elif info.status == 'evidence_insufficient' %}text-bg-warning{% else %}text-bg-secondary{% endif %}">{% if info.status == 'evidence_found' %}Evidence Found{% elif info.status == 'evidence_not_found' %}Evidence Not Found{% elif info.status == 'evidence_insufficient' %}Evidence Insufficient{% elif info.status == 'not_applicable' %}Not Applicable{% else %}{{ info.status|default:"Unknown" }}{% endif %}</span></div>{% for item in info.evidence %}<div class="mt-2 pt-2 border-top"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-1"><span class="text-muted small">{{ item.source|default:"unknown source" }}</span><span class="badge badge-tl">score {{ item.score|floatformat:2 }}</span></div><p class="text-muted small mb-0">{{ item.verbatim_text|default:"—"|truncatechars:400 }}</p></div>{% empty %}<p class="text-muted small mb-0 mt-2">No supporting evidence retrieved for this dimension.</p>{% endfor %}</div></div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<p class="text-muted small mb-0">No candidate-specific legal evidence was retrieved for this application — either every 